  "translation": "Gomme wena o theetše magodimong, gomme o dire, gomme o atlhola ⟨את⟩ mehlanka ya gago: go mo bolela molato yo mobe, go beha tsela ya gage tlhogo ya gage; gomme go mo bolela toka yo a lokilego, go mo nea go ya ka tsedeke ya gage.",
